// A partial is a piece several emails share: a type with the
// `EmailPartial` base, its `.html` and `.txt` beside it as an email's
// are. In `shared/emails/` every domain's emails may include it; in a
// domain's own `emails/` only that domain's may. A template includes it
// as `{{ include button(label: ..., url: ...) }}`, giving each field
// once by name, and the partial is written in the including email's
// language.

/// A link set as a button, in every email that asks the guest to act.
type Button = EmailPartial {
    label: PresentationText
    url: Url
}
